// TestSetupTracer_HappyPath_Insecure exercises the full SetupTracer
// path with the WithOTLPInsecure opt-in: exporter, resource, provider
// wiring, and the returned shutdown closure. otlptracegrpc.New is
// non-blocking by default, so an unreachable endpoint is fine — we
// just need the constructor + shutdown to run without error so the
